NSAppleEventsUsageDescription DiskSpaceSaver asks Finder to open the Get Info window for an item you pick. NSDesktopFolderUsageDescription DiskSpaceSaver needs to read your folders to measure what is using disk space. NSDocumentsFolderUsageDescription DiskSpaceSaver needs to read your folders to measure what is using disk space. NSDownloadsFolderUsageDescription DiskSpaceSaver needs to read your folders to measure what is using disk space. NSRemovableVolumesUsageDescription DiskSpaceSaver scans removable volumes you choose. SUFeedURL https://updates.diskspacesaver.app/appcast.xml
